abstract: "A conditional Lean 4 / Mathlib formalisation of parts of Sections 3, 5 and 6 of OpenAI's 23 September 2026 preprint 'Planar Graph Metrics Embed into L1 with Constant Distortion'. Hypotheses taken from other sections are explicit; no sorry, no new axioms. Not reviewed by an expert."
